      <data key="d57">interface_failure</data>
      <data key="d58">missing function: train; missing function: predict; missing function: evaluate; missing function: metadata</data>
      <data key="d59">The provided code does not implement the required functions for training, predicting, evaluating, and providing metadata about the model.</data>
      <data key="d60">Implement all required functions: train, predict, evaluate, metadata, and predict_proba with proper sklearn pipeline usage for binary classification.</data>
      <data key="d61">False</data>
      <data key="d62">Always ensure that all required functions are implemented when developing machine learning models to avoid interface failures during validation.</data>
      <data key="d15">2026-09-07T16:16:33.472582+00:00</data>
